# Runtime data (SQLite DB, hook token, bookmarks) — root-anchored, so the
# in-package resource dirs (discovery/data, monitoring/data, interception/data)
# stay trackable. The un-anchored "data/" pattern used to hide agents.yaml,
# llm_sdks.yaml and the framework_*.yaml rules from the repository entirely.
/data/
*.sqlite3
.env
.DS_Store
.zcode/

# build artifacts (pip install -e)
*.egg-info/
